	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">A characteristic is a generic container of information that can be attached to many elements of the model. Each characteristic is identified by a FullName that must be unique for its owner. It stores its value in a Value element.

Characteristics are unique among siblings by their FullName property. A characteristic is uniquely identified by the combination of its owner's identifier and its FullName</Property>
